# Rust & Cargo build artifacts
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock

# Compiled binaries
*.exe

# Node / Web / NPM
**/node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Runtime dynamic states & logs (generated by bridge & app)
**/out/*.json
**/out/*.txt
!**/out/.gitkeep
**/*.log
**/_probe.log
**/_probe_error.log
**/_control.json
**/mo_hud.ini

# C / C++ compiled intermediate objects
**/*.obj
**/*.pdb
**/*.ilk
**/*.idb

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# IDE & OS files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
